{"id":"1cb4649e6af56ba4","group":"43","path":"43/43-df-string.md","title":"有限二进制字符串","display":"df-string — 有限二进制字符串","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-df-string","aliases":["43-df-string"],"display":"df-string — 有限二进制字符串","depends_on":[],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28","source_location":"§4.1, print pp.2–3 / PDF pp.22–23","source_scope":"book","verification_status":"formalization-reviewed","source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-df-string"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-df-string</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-string — 有限二进制字符串"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§4.1, print pp.2–3 / PDF pp.22–23"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"formalization-reviewed"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N=\\omega\">\\(\\mathbb N=\\omega\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0=\\varnothing\">\\(0=\\varnothing\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n+1=n\\cup\\{n\\}\">\\(n+1=n\\cup\\{n\\}\\)</span>；每个自然数同时表示集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{i\\in\\mathbb N:i&lt;n\\}\">\\(\\{i\\in\\mathbb N:i&lt;n\\}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n,k\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n,k\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b\\in\\Sigma\">\\(b\\in\\Sigma\\)</span>；有限序列均为有限初始序数上的函数。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma^n:=2^n:=\\{\\sigma:\\sigma:n\\to\\Sigma\\},\\qquad2^{&lt;\\omega}:=\\Sigma^*:=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\Sigma^n,\\qquad\\varepsilon:=\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Sigma^n:=2^n:=\\{\\sigma:\\sigma:n\\to\\Sigma\\},\\qquad2^{&lt;\\omega}:=\\Sigma^*:=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\Sigma^n,\\qquad\\varepsilon:=\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"|\\sigma|:=\\operatorname{dom}(\\sigma)\\qquad(\\sigma\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[|\\sigma|:=\\operatorname{dom}(\\sigma)\\qquad(\\sigma\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\langle b\\rangle_1:=\\{(0,b)\\},\\qquad b^n:=\\{(i,b):i&lt;n\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\langle b\\rangle_1:=\\{(0,b)\\},\\qquad b^n:=\\{(i,b):i&lt;n\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\\tau:=\\sigma\\cup\\{(|\\sigma|+j,\\tau(j)):j&lt;|\\tau|\\}\\qquad(\\sigma,\\tau\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\sigma\\tau:=\\sigma\\cup\\{(|\\sigma|+j,\\tau(j)):j&lt;|\\tau|\\}\\qquad(\\sigma,\\tau\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\sigma b:=\\sigma\\langle b\\rangle_1,\\qquad b\\sigma:=\\langle b\\rangle_1\\sigma\\qquad(\\sigma\\in2^{&lt;\\omega},\\ b\\in\\Sigma).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\sigma b:=\\sigma\\langle b\\rangle_1,\\qquad b\\sigma:=\\langle b\\rangle_1\\sigma\\qquad(\\sigma\\in2^{&lt;\\omega},\\ b\\in\\Sigma).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\\upharpoonright k:=\\{(i,\\sigma(i)):i&lt;k\\}\\qquad(\\sigma\\in2^{&lt;\\omega},\\ k\\le|\\sigma|).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\sigma\\upharpoonright k:=\\{(i,\\sigma(i)):i&lt;k\\}\\qquad(\\sigma\\in2^{&lt;\\omega},\\ k\\le|\\sigma|).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>有限序数约定已移入前提。单比特拼接中的比特先转为长度1的串，因而σ0、σ1及0^n均不依赖未声明的类型转换。</p>\n<p>来源定位沿用附件：§4.1, print pp.2–3 / PDF pp.22–23。本轮核查形式化的内部一致性；未重新核对原书完整证明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbb N=\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"0=\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"n+1=n\\cup\\{n\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\{i\\in\\mathbb N:i<n\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"n,k\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"b\\in\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma^n:=2^n:=\\{\\sigma:\\sigma:n\\to\\Sigma\\},\\qquad2^{<\\omega}:=\\Sigma^*:=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\Sigma^n,\\qquad\\varepsilon:=\\varnothing.","display":true},{"tex":"|\\sigma|:=\\operatorname{dom}(\\sigma)\\qquad(\\sigma\\in2^{<\\omega}).","display":true},{"tex":"\\langle b\\rangle_1:=\\{(0,b)\\},\\qquad b^n:=\\{(i,b):i<n\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\sigma\\tau:=\\sigma\\cup\\{(|\\sigma|+j,\\tau(j)):j<|\\tau|\\}\\qquad(\\sigma,\\tau\\in2^{<\\omega}).","display":true},{"tex":"\\sigma b:=\\sigma\\langle b\\rangle_1,\\qquad b\\sigma:=\\langle b\\rangle_1\\sigma\\qquad(\\sigma\\in2^{<\\omega},\\ b\\in\\Sigma).","display":true},{"tex":"\\sigma\\upharpoonright k:=\\{(i,\\sigma(i)):i<k\\}\\qquad(\\sigma\\in2^{<\\omega},\\ k\\le|\\sigma|).","display":true}],"bytes":1598,"backlinks":[{"id":"1d74032e32e804fb","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"e79ea45002ccf795","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"dabe289b82d34117","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$m:\\Sigma^*\\to[0,\\infty)$；$\\varepsilon$ 为空串，连接运算见 [[43-df-string]]，$\\mathrm{LSC}$ 见 [[43-df-lower-semicomputable-function]]。"},{"id":"2352967b8ac4bcf4","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"0164c575eca36621","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"aa33e0ea8422ba2a","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"565c3258eee2a5ff","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}$，有限序列及自然数的有限序数表示采用 [[43-df-string]]。$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$，$X\\in2^\\omega$，$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$\\sigma\\in2^{<\\omega}$。以下分支依声明类型使用；集合预言机与序列预言机的共同参数域为 $\\mathcal O$。"},{"id":"eb52618778abed91","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"cc3ac987908461b8","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"0038977b84ae1a9f","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"设 $d:2^{<\\omega}\\to\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}$；$\\sigma b$ 表示在有限二进制串后附加 $b\\in\\{0,1\\}$（see [[43-df-string]]）。"},{"id":"07d0eb32ffc2cbc0","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[43-df-string]] 的 $\\Sigma^*=2^{<\\omega}$、$\\varepsilon$、串长及连接运算。 $U,M:\\Sigma^*\\rightharpoonup\\Sigma^*$；$\\mathrm{Computable}$ 表示部分可计算性，等式 $U(\\rho p)\\simeq M(p)$ 表示两边同时无定义或同时有定义且相等。"},{"id":"19dbd8d7e38e55f5","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"e039afac1517f3d7","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Sigma^*=2^{<\\omega}$、串长及连接采用 [[43-df-string]]。$n,k\\in\\mathbb N$，$\\sigma,\\tau\\in\\Sigma^*$。$\\iota$ 为唯一描述算子；$\\mathbf 0\\in\\Sigma^1$ 和 $1^k\\in\\Sigma^k$ 由下式定义。串配对 $\\langle\\sigma,\\tau\\rangle$ 与自然数配对按参数类型区分。"},{"id":"df8eac4626d45afe","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$E$ 为携带 [[43-df-effective-coding]] 中指定编码的域，$d:E\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb R$；$m:2^{<\\omega}\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}$、$D=\\operatorname{dom}(m)$。部分可计算性采用 [[43-df-computable]]，串连接采用 [[43-df-string]]。$\\operatorname{graph}$ 表示部分函数图。"},{"id":"801a9dba9cbba1c7","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\sigma,\\tau\\in2^{<\\omega}$，$X\\in2^\\omega$，采用 [[43-df-string]] 与 [[43-df-infseq]] 的函数图表示。"},{"id":"e7071caa967351d5","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$S\\subseteq\\Sigma^*$；有限串集合采用 [[43-df-string]]，前缀关系 $\\sqsubseteq$ 采用 [[43-df-prefix]]。以下定义谓词 $\\mathrm{PrefixFree}$。"},{"id":"5cac6460c6fc0b98","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"设 $r:2^{<\\omega}\\rightharpoonup\\{0,1\\}$，$X\\in2^\\omega$；有限串与可计算性见 [[43-df-string]]、[[43-df-computable]]。$r(\\sigma)\\downarrow=1$ 表示在看到σ后选择下一位，0表示不选择。$n,N,M\\in\\mathbb N$；部分规则遇到未定义的前缀时停止，选取位置集合由下式定义。"},{"id":"37cd2e44802c0a69","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$s\\in\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}$，$d:2^{<\\omega}\\to\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}$；二进制有限串见 [[43-df-string]]。"},{"id":"fd20d0fb1ced54f7","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"4e70aa52bbf815a8","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"设 $d:2^{<\\omega}\\to\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}$；有限串及附加运算见 [[43-df-string]]。"},{"id":"c6501493b1a4f2e7","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\square\\notin\\{0,1\\}$ 是固定符号；二进制串和空串 $\\varepsilon$ 见 [[43-df-string]]，$\\#_2$ 见 [[43-df-effective-coding]]。$\\sigma\\in2^{<\\omega}$，$u\\in\\mathcal T$；$\\mathcal T$、$\\sigma\\square$、$|u|$ 和编码 $\\#_{\\mathcal T}$ 由下式定义。$s\\in\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}$，$d:\\mathcal T\\to\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}$，$D,E\\in(\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}^{\\mathcal T})^{\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}}$；$D_s=D(s)$、$E_s=E(s)$。$\\operatorname{LSC}_{\\mathcal T}$ 采用 [[43-df-lower-semicomputable-function]]，其域编码为 $\\#_{\\mathcal T}$。"},{"id":"267fe4584e3c0212","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"f5078ab697e20add","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[43-df-string]] 的 $\\Sigma^*=2^{<\\omega}$、$\\varepsilon$、串长及连接运算。 $U,M:\\Sigma^*\\rightharpoonup\\Sigma^*$；$\\mathrm{PrefixFree}$ 见 [[43-df-prefixfree]]，部分可计算性见 [[43-df-computable]]，$\\simeq$ 为部分函数的相等。"},{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-df-string]] — 有限二进制字符串"},{"id":"275ee98c00f161f8","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"63e59320a814619c","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"aa27c371fc415029","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":[]}